{"seq":1,"slug":"foundation-of-philosophy","title":"Foundation Of Philosophy","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/influence-and-legacy/foundation-of-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-footnote-to-plato","title":"对柏拉图的注脚","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/influence-and-legacy/foundation-of-philosophy/a-footnote-to-plato","wordCount":2038,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"aristotle-and-the-academy","title":"亚里士多德与学园","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/influence-and-legacy/foundation-of-philosophy/aristotle-and-the-academy","wordCount":2213,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现柏拉图作为西方哲学奠基者的地位。怀特海的名言&quot;整个西方哲学不过是对柏拉图的一系列注脚&quot;，道出了柏拉图无与伦比的奠基性地位——他提出了哲学的根本问题，开创了影响深远的思想传统。而他最杰出的弟子亚里士多德，以及延续数百年的学园，则是柏拉图影响最直接、最辉煌的体现。本章揭示柏拉图作为西方思想之源头的崇高地位。</p>\n"}